		COMMENT Registers (or reuses) the AnimationSet for a given UnitAnimationType during ini parsing. If a set already exists for that action type it is reused, except when the caller is parsing a "graphics" block (boolean true) and the existing set already has events - that combination raises a UnitConfigException, because a unit may not define both "graphics" images and "onAction" images for the same action. Returns the set to fill in.
